---
// Hero section: eyebrow + title + sub + ctas + stats strip + floating terminal.
---

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="ebar"></span>
      <span data-en>Product engineer</span><span data-es>Product engineer</span>
      <span class="sep"></span>
      <span>Santiago, Chile</span>
      <span class="sep"></span>
      <b data-en>Available for projects</b><b data-es>Disponible para proyectos</b>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      <span data-en>Most “engineering” problems</span>
      <span data-es>La mayoría de los problemas de “ingeniería”</span>
      <span class="l2">
        <span data-en>are misframed business problems<span class="accent-dot">.</span></span>
        <span data-es>son problemas de negocio mal encuadrados<span class="accent-dot">.</span></span>
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-sub">
      <span data-en>I find the four-hour bottleneck and ship the schema that kills it. <b>Zero to 4,127 commits in 12 months.</b></span>
      <span data-es>Encuentro el cuello de botella de cuatro horas y shippeo el schema que lo mata. <b>De cero a 4,127 commits en 12 meses.</b></span>
    </p>

    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#work">
        <span data-en>View work</span><span data-es>Ver trabajo</span>
        <span class="arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#methodology">
        <span data-en>How I build</span><span data-es>Cómo construyo</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-strip">
      <div class="strip-item">
        <div class="num">4,127<span class="plus">+</span></div>
        <div class="lbl" data-en>Commits · 12 mo</div>
        <div class="lbl" data-es>Commits · 12 meses</div>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-item">
        <div class="num">36<span class="plus">+</span></div>
        <div class="lbl" data-en>Public repos</div>
        <div class="lbl" data-es>Repos públicos</div>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-item">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <div class="lbl" data-en>CRMs in production</div>
        <div class="lbl" data-es>CRMs en producción</div>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-item">
        <div class="num">42<span class="plus">%</span></div>
        <div class="lbl" data-en>Conversion lift</div>
        <div class="lbl" data-es>Lift de conversión</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-terminal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ht-head">
      <span>~/elkis</span>
      <span class="dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="ht-body">
      <div><span class="p">$</span> <span class="c">whoami</span></div>
      <div><span class="o">elkis daza · product engineer</span></div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="c">cat .build</span></div>
      <div><span class="o">crm/</span> <span class="ct">// lead scoring + whatsapp</span></div>
      <div><span class="o">platform/</span> <span class="ct">// next · supabase · ai</span></div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;"><span class="p">$</span> <span class="ht-cursor"></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    padding: 180px 0 96px;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #1c1c1f 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 28px 28px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 50%,
      #000 30%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -200px;
    left: -100px;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle,
      var(--accent-glow) 0%,
      transparent 60%
    );
    opacity: 0.18;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow .ebar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 11px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    animation: blink 1.2s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }
  .eyebrow .sep {
    width: 16px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-hair-strong);
  }
  .eyebrow b {
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hero-title {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 7.5vw, 104px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .hero-title .l2 {
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    display: block;
  }
  .hero-title .accent-dot {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-shadow: 0 0 32px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .hero-sub b {
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    cursor: pointer;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    transition: background 180ms, border-color 180ms, color 180ms,
      box-shadow 180ms, transform 180ms;
  }
  .btn .arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 400;
    transition: transform 180ms;
  }
  .btn:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #0a0a0b;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 0 32px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--color-surface-2);
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    border-color: var(--color-hair-strong);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-3);
    border-color: var(--color-text-3);
  }

  .hero-strip {
    margin-top: 72px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .strip-item .num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 2px;
  }
  .strip-item .num .plus {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .strip-item .lbl {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .hero-terminal {
    position: absolute;
    top: 152px;
    right: 32px;
    width: 320px;
    background: var(--color-surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .ht-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .ht-head .dots {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .ht-head .dots span {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-hair-strong);
  }
  .ht-head .dots span:first-child {
    background: #ff6b5c66;
  }
  .ht-body {
    padding: 16px 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .ht-body .p {
    color: var(--color-text-3);
  }
  .ht-body .c {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .ht-body .o {
    color: var(--color-text-1);
  }
  .ht-body .ct {
    color: var(--color-text-3);
  }
  .ht-cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 7px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateY(2px);
    animation: blink 1s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-terminal {
      display: none;
    }
    .hero-title {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 130px;
      min-height: auto;
    }
    .hero-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
